n H20. Validation here targets the deterministic scale calculation and real GPU quantization; no full-model quality or performance claim is made.\n\n## Details\n\n`Tensor.amax()` returns the largest signed value. FP8 scaling needs the largest magnitude; use `tensor.abs().amax()` before updating the existing circular history. This applies to models using the shared vision FP8 dynamic-scaling path, including DeepSeek V4.1. Static-scale loading and BF16 attention are unchanged. The added absolute-value operation stays on device and introduces no host synchronization.\n\nTargeted searches for open PRs covering `MMEncoderAttention`/`amax`, vision FP8 scaling, and absolute-maximum fixes found no duplicate.\n\nAI assistance was used to identify, implement, and validate this change with Codex.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill. (Mandatory for agents, optional for humans).\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n- [x] **Design Fit:** One-line change in the existing scale calculation; no new abstractions.\n- [x] **Testing and Validation:** CPU and H20 quantization reproduction passed; existing regression enhanced, with hardware and model-evaluation limitations documented above.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Full pre-commit checks passed.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Includes root cause, before/after evidence, duplicate checks, and validation limits.\n</details>\n\n",
